TICKER_END

WAIT 3

OVERLAY
NEXT WEEK ON COLDWATER'S FINEST

A ROUTINE STOP AT THE NORTH LOCKS

TWO OFFICERS. ONE SUSPECT. NINE BODIES.
OVERLAY_END

♪ The cheap guitar riff returns, fading out over the wet street. ♪

